CHAPTER.VERS:
And David went out to meet them, and answered and said to them, If you

          {+}
         have come peaceably to me to help me, my heart will be knit to you

          {+}
        ; but if [you

          {+}
         have come] to betray me to my adversaries, seeing there is no wrong in my hands, the God of our fathers look on it, and rebuke it.
